  {
    "schema_version": 2,
    "locale": "en-US",
    "key": "talent.212.description",
    "text": "Replaces <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> with <linktext=1509><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">​Frostbeam​</style></linktext> and enhances the skill.<br>Every <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystal</style></linktext> increases <linktext=1509><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">​Frostbeam​</style></linktext> DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style>. Each <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Mastery grants an additional <style=\"accent-gn\">0.85%</style> DMG bonus (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>) and increases the <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> consumed by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>.<br>When <linktext=1509><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">​Frostbeam​</style></linktext> hits a target, every <style=\"accent-gn\">13</style> hits reduce the remaining CD of <linktext=1515><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Permafrost</style></linktext>by <style=\"accent-gn\">1s</style> (hitting multiple targets only counts once).<br><br><i><style=\"text_third_gray\"><size=20>Consumes Ice Energy to channel Frostbeam continuously at the target. High Haste and Mastery greatly speed up its channeling while improving Ice Energy recovery.</size></style></i>",
    "availability": [
